tion might explain the deviation from the expected order.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"cmd.exe /c \"cd /d C:\\Users\\Pavan\\hackerrank-orchestrate-october26 && git log -n 5 --stat\"","WaitMsBeforeAsync":10000,"toolSummary":"Check git log"}}]}
